{"text": "influential", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Medieval Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">\u012bnfluenti\u0101lis</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">\u012bnfluentia</i> + <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">-\u0101lis</i>. By surface analysis, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">influence</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ial</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": "Having or exerting influence.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}, {"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "A person who has influence", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u026anflu\u02c8\u025bn\u0283\u0259l/"]]}